1. Report-Level Processing-Each culture block represents a single accession and serves as the primary unit of parsing.
pages <- readLines(file)
culture_blocks <- split_culture_reports(pages)

2. Culture-Level Metadata Extraction- Name, Accession, Procedure, Source, Collect_Date
meta <- get_culture_info(block)

3. Organism Segmentation-Each culture is split into separate organism sections.
Each organism block contains both the organism identification and its associated susceptibility panel.
org_blocks <- get_org_blocks(block)

4. Organism Parsing-Organism names are extracted independently of susceptibility data.
parse_org_block()

5. Antibiotic Susceptibility Parsing-Susceptibility panels are parsed from each organism block.
parse_abx_block()
